    ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)={x}^{2}{e}^{2x},$ find ${f}^{'}(x).$\n\n${f}^{'}(x)=2x{e}^{2x}\\,+$\n{{field-1}}",
    ":question/worked-solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={x}^{2}$ and $v(x)={e}^{2x}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{'}(x) & =({x}^{2})^{'}{e}^{2x}+{x}^{2}({e}^{2x})^{'} \\\\  & =(2x)({e}^{2x})+({x}^{2})(2{e}^{2x}) \\\\  & =2x{e}^{2x}+2{x}^{2}{e}^{2x}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
