    ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)=5{x}^{2}{e}^{x},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=10x{e}^{x}\\,+$\n{{field-1}}",
    ":question/worked-solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)=5{x}^{2}$ and $v(x)={e}^{x}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =(5{x}^{2})^{′}{e}^{x}+5{x}^{2}({e}^{x})^{′} \\\\  & =(10x)({e}^{x})+(5{x}^{2})({e}^{x}) \\\\  & =10x{e}^{x}+5{x}^{2}{e}^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
